ng> Remove unused keys at any time from the SSH Keys Manager.</span></p></li><li data-end=\"3032\" data-start=\"2949\"><p data-end=\"3032\" data-start=\"2951\"><span style=\"font-size: 13px;\"><strong data-end=\"2978\" data-start=\"2951\" dir=\"ltr\">Import Additional Keys:</strong> Repeat the process for other devices or team members.</span></p></li></ul><blockquote data-end=\"3093\" data-start=\"3034\"><p data-end=\"3093\" data-start=\"3036\" dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"font-size: 13px;\">Tip: Regularly rotate your keys for improved security.</span></p></blockquote><hr data-start=\"3095\" data-end=\"3098\"><h2 data-end=\"3126\" data-start=\"3100\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 13px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 13px;\">Troubleshooting Tips</span></h2><ul data-end=\"3350\" data-start=\"3128\"><li data-end=\"3213\" data-start=\"3128\"><p data-end=\"3213\" data-start=\"3130\" dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"font-size: 13px;\">Can\u2019t connect? Double-check your key is authorized and the username/IP are correct.</span></p></li><li data-end=\"3276\" data-start=\"3214\"><p data-end=\"3276\" data-start=\"3216\" dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"font-size: 13px;\">Issues on Linux? Install <code data-end=\"3248\" data-start=\"3241\">xclip</code> if clipboard commands fail.</span></p></li><li data-end=\"3350\" data-start=\"3277\"><p data-end=\"3350\" data-start=\"3279\" dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"font-size: 13px;\">Use <code data-end=\"3306\" data-start=\"3283\">ssh-add ~/.ssh/id_rsa</code> if you're using a passphrase-protected key.</span></p></li></ul><hr data-start=\"3352\" data-end=\"3355\"><p data-end=\"3433\" data-start=\"3357\" dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"font-size: 13px;\">Need further help? Reach out to your Agency for assistance.</span></p>\n\t"}, {"slug": "48001238250-how-to-use-the-date-time-formatter-premium-workflow-action-", "title": "How to use the Date/Time Formatter Premium Workflow Action?", "folder": "Workflow", "images": ["../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/d