ion: ; --tw-ordinal: ; --tw-slashed-zero: ; --tw-numeric-figure: ; --tw-numeric-spacing: ; --tw-numeric-fraction: ; --tw-ring-inset: ; --tw-ring-offset-width: 0px; --tw-ring-offset-color: #fff; --tw-ring-color: rgba(69,89,164,.5); --tw-ring-offset-shadow: 0 0 transparent; --tw-ring-shadow: 0 0 transparent; --tw-shadow: 0 0 transparent; --tw-shadow-colored: 0 0 transparent; --tw-blur: ; --tw-brightness: ; --tw-contrast: ; --tw-grayscale: ; --tw-hue-rotate: ; --tw-invert: ; --tw-saturate: ; --tw-sepia: ; --tw-drop-shadow: ; --tw-backdrop-blur: ; --tw-backdrop-brightness: ; --tw-backdrop-contrast: ; --tw-backdrop-grayscale: ; --tw-backdrop-hue-rotate: ; --tw-backdrop-invert: ; --tw-backdrop-opacity: ; --tw-backdrop-saturate: ; --tw-backdrop-sepia: ; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; color: rgb(55, 65, 81); font-family: S\u00f6hne, ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Ubuntu, Cantarell, &quot;Noto Sans&quot;, sans-serif, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;, &quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 16px;\">A: To view appointments in the business timezone, set your user timezone to match the business timezone. For example, User A can set their timezone as EST to view appointments in the New York timezone.</span></p><p><br></p><p><br></p>\n\t"}, {"slug": "155000004694-resolving-conflicted-duplicate-state-entity-in-yext", "title": "Resolving Conflicted/Duplicate State Entity in Yext", "folder": "Review Management", "images": ["../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155042666726/original/1oz_oUzl7Q-vKzAsik_-vAE2ktB21BbzCA9211.png?1741160148", "../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155042666728/original/w7TVouN7Fe7dEJV18pAjWrQxhQ-0PKraqA9211.png?1741160148", "../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155042666725/original/Vuhy5vZBufjjRQN-juAKmyTb2GSFTYHyYg9211.jpg?1741160148"], "videos": [], "content": "\n\t\t<div class=\"ql-block\" data-block-id=\"block-59b75db3-b47f-4409-b93f-12e703f76a46\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction: ltr;\">If a business is already active on Yext through another provider, users may encounter a conflicted state. Follow these three steps to resolve the issue and regain access to Yext services.</div><div class=\"ql-block\" data-block-id=\"block-158de760-9c18-40c6-965a-ba0a79fbe63e\" style=\"direction: ltr;\"><img class=\"ql-img ql-img-smooth fr-fic fr-dii\" src=\"../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155042666726/original/1oz_oUzl7Q-vKzAsik_-vAE2ktB21BbzCA9211.png?1741160148\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"155042666726\" style=\"max-width: 100%;\"></div><h3 class=\"ql-heading\" data-block-id=\"block-c7a44067-cfa0-4d3d-852e-4cc530a42277\" id=\"\"><br></h3><p class=\"fd-toc\"><strong>TABLE OF CONTENTS</strong></p><p style=\"margin-left: 20px;\"><a href=\"#%E2%80%8B%E2%80%8B1.-Information-Gathering\">1. Information Gathering</a></p><p style=\"margin-left: 20px;\"><a href=\"#2.-Contact-Yext-and-Cancel-the-Service\">2. Contact Yext and Cancel the Service</a></p><p style=\"margin-left: 20px;\"><a href=\"#3.-Request-Yext-Service-Again\">3. Request Yext Service Again</a></p><h3 class=\"ql-heading\" data-block-id=\"block-b28992cb-3c30-4e7c-b913-40998b9d1590\" id=\"\u200b\u200b1.-Information-Gathering\"><br><strong dir=\"ltr\">1. Information Gathering</strong></h3><div class=\"ql-block\" data-block-id=\"block-1e2a4cc7-18db-4bdb-926c-d05d8cc1abc4\">To proceed with cancellation, the business owner must collect the necessary details:</div><ul><li><strong>Entity ID</strong>: Navigate to <em>Listings &gt;&gt; Business Entities &gt;&gt; Conflicted Entity (Entity ID)</em>.</li><li><strong>Business Name</strong></li><li><strong>Address</strong></li><li><strong>Phone Number</strong><br><br><strong><img class=\"ql-img ql-img-smooth fr-fic fr-dii\" src=\"../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155042666728/original/w7TVouN7Fe7dEJV18pAjWrQxhQ-0PKraqA9211.png?1741160148\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"155042666728\" style=\"max-width: 100%;\"></strong><br><br></li></ul><div class=\"ql-block\" data-block-id=\"block-fb37eff6-3ea7-41d3-99ad-aba665e41019\">This information is essential for Yext to verify and process the request.<br><br><br></div><h3 class=\"ql-heading\" data-block-id=\"block-5b293abc-2fd8-483f-84b8-b106fae54cb6\" id=\"2.-Contact-Yext-and-Cancel-the-Service\"><strong>2. Contact Yext and Cancel the Service</strong></h3><div class=\"ql-block\" data-block-id=\"block-5bed1068-1d94-46ce-8628-9e47099112b4\">The <strong>business owner must directly contact Yext</strong> at <strong><a class=\"ql-link\" href=\"mailto:locationconflict@yext.com\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">locationconflict@yext.com</a></strong> to request cancellation. Yext provides two cancellation options:</div><ul><li><strong>Cancel Immediately</strong></li><li><strong>Cancel at the End of the Billing Cycle</strong></li></ul><div class=\"ql-block\" data-block-id=\"block-d7b389fd-5b05-48bf-ab0d-8c0eda048e30\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction: ltr;\">It is mandatory that business owner choose to cancel the Yext service immediately.</div><div class=\"ql-block\" data-block-id=\"block-84b87841-2a37-4224-b03f-7d99a70a7122\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction: ltr; margin-left: 20px;\"><br><strong>Email Format:</strong></div><div class=\"ql-block\" data-block-id=\"block-4982fc23-7c10-4c59-a8a1-2d3891eb1a7d\" style=\"direction: ltr; margin-left: 20px;\"><br></div><div class=\"ql-block\" data-block-id=\"block-fa015db7-008c-40df-a72d-4e68427ccb69\" style=\"direction: ltr; margin-left: 20px;\"><strong>To</strong>: <strong><a class=\"ql-link\" href=\"mailto:locationconflict@yext.com\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">locationconflict@yext.com</a></strong>&nbsp;</div><div class=\"ql-block\" data-block-id=\"block-ba55d78b-bc0e-4cff-a633-49ed31b3b200\" style=\"direction: ltr; margin-left: 20px;\"><strong>Subject</strong>: Listing stuck in conflicted state {Entity ID}</div><div class=\"ql-block\" data-block-id=\"block-eb1d1916-effe-4d79-96fa-14803a536cd8\" style=\"direction: ltr; margin-left: 20px;\"><strong dir=\"ltr\">Message Body:</strong></div><div class=\"ql-block\" data-block-id=\"block-2281e088-69c5-4ccd-8657-c2f453154b54\" style=\"margin-left: 40px;\">Hello Yext Team,</div><div class=\"ql-block\" data-block-id=\"block-f25b3e03-b498-4506-b120-60b441fc09c4\" style=\"margin-left: 40px;\">Our Online Listings request has moved to a conflicted state. Could you please assist us in resolving this?</div><div class=\"ql-block\" data-block-id=\"block-90ac6881-8a79-405f-9096-9a50ed88a5c9\" style=\"margin-left: 40px;\"><strong>Business Details:</strong></div><ul><li style=\"margin-left: 40px;\"><strong>Business Name:</strong> [Name of Business]</li><li style=\"margin-left: 40px;\"><strong>Business Address:</strong> [Address of Business]</li><li style=\"margin-left: 40px;\"><strong>Business Phone Number:</strong> [Phone Number]</li></ul><div class=\"ql-block\" data-block-id=\"block-3a4684e9-f4e1-434a-958f-73d1ea7a9b0e\" style=\"margin-left: 40px;\">We appreciate your help and look forward to your response.</div><div class=\"ql-block\" data-block-id=\"block-1cf9fdc0-e3dc-4f80-a39d-68716ff69368\" style=\"margin-left: 40px;\">Best regards,</div><div class=\"ql-block\" data-block-id=\"block-35049be0-2750-4938-bf26-822c6442a457\" style=\"margin-left: 40px;\">[Your Name]</div><div class=\"ql-block\" data-block-id=\"block-84c56d38-09e4-4d13-9910-c7de499c32ad\" style=\"margin-left: 40px;\">[Your Contact Information]</div><div class=\"ql-block\" data-block-id=\"block-7edbe14d-74ef-413a-a071-10fc01fb56ce\" style=\"margin-left: 40px;\">[Your Company Name]<br><br></div><h3 class=\"ql-heading\" data-block-id=\"block-9941999c-7285-439e-af63-0c5372dc8296\" id=\"3.-Request-Yext-Service-Again\"><strong>3. Request Yext Service Again</strong></h3><div class=\"ql-block\" data-block-id=\"block-f5011cab-4dea-4e60-8125-6be0df49317b\" style=\"direction: ltr;\">Once the cancellation is confirmed, the business can request Yext service again from the system.<strong>&nbsp;</strong><u>If the issue persists, please reach out to your administrator for further assistance.</u><br><br></div><div class=\"ql-block\" data-block-id=\"block-45aeebe8-78a8-4658-8f0c-9642f5d65062\" style=\"direction: ltr;\"><img class=\"ql-img ql-img-smooth fr-fic fr-dii\" src=\"../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155042666725/original/Vuhy5vZBufjjRQN-juAKmyTb2GSFTYHyYg9211.jpg?1741160148\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"155042666725\" style=\"max-width: 100%;\"></div><div class=\"ql-block\" data-block-id=\"block-8c29a8de-8401-496e-80e6-f2137c4b38aa\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction: ltr;\"><br>Following these steps will ensure a smooth resolution of the conflict, allowing the business to restore its Yext services effectively.</div>\n\t"}, {"slug": "155000006869-a-basic-guide-of-rss-campaign", "title": "A basic guide of RSS Campaign", "folder": "RSS Guide", "images": ["../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155057347147/original/lGK6aiX9Wkq2TxBPs0b3Tbk3hp3byP_a0Q4bc7.jpg?1761941019", "../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155057347146/original/Jfr0tTW3Wd9YiIqJ76T-M-yHkQEJ_thCFw4bc7.png?1761941019", "../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155057347143/original/h5rFZJNjL1OEfE5kegNyK0wJaW1UUS19wwd25c.png?1761941018", "../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155057347148/original/OGH5ARbD1V2Vdp19ouZ_8K9cKkbobyif0w4bc7.jpg?1761941019", "../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155057347145/original/u2uHYUTYpP8Qk8mjk0FgjSKBjAr5CjZn-g4bc7.png?1761941019", "../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155057347144/original/sNC3po584BCrPUaFa3fZMqMjzt8XoJ60IA4bc7.png?1761941019", "../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155057347150/original/1HAdVx_LLHi6aURUdUrjVl1hT2pqxbVcOg7609.png?1761941020"], "videos": [], "content": "\n\t\t<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Arial, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\">In HighLevel, you can include an RSS feed (Item and Header) in your direct and automated campaigns using the RSS content block. This allows your subscribers to automatically receive and read updates from online content sources, like blog posts and news articles.</p><h2 dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Arial, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; line-height: 35px; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 1.5em; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">How does an RSS Campaign work?</strong></h2><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Arial, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Arial, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\">You can insert an RSS item or header element and add your RSS feed URL in the send or schedule section. All feed updates published between the time you schedule the campaign and when the email is sent will be included. You can customise the feed layout by selecting the tags you want to display from the feed.<br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">Usual RSS Items</strong><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">When you add an RSS Element, depending on what all details are present in your feed, you can use the respective custom values in the builder and it would automatically get the relevant data.<br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">For Example, if you wish to add blog title and content only,<br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">Step 1: Add a RSS header to your template</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Arial, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\">Step 2: Ensure we have {{rss_item.title}} and {{rss_item.content}}. Depending on what field is needed, add the respective custom values<br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">Step 3: In your send or schedule section add your RSS URL</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Arial, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\">Step 4: Schedule your campaign<br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">Behaviour:</strong> When the campaign is sent, in the template the contact can see all blog titles and content from the day it was scheduled</p><div class=\"clickup-table-view\" data-identifyelement=\"587\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.4; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; color: rgb(10, 33, 61); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"></div><h2 data-identifyelement=\"645\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; line-height: 1.4; color: rgb(10, 33, 61); margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 15px; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">Details about the RSS header and item block</strong><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">What is RSS header?</strong></h2><p data-identifyelement=\"522\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; color: rgb(10, 33, 61); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\">This will dynamically populate &lt;channel&gt; tags from your RSS Feed&nbsp;<span data-identifyelement=\"524\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">. The RSS Header Element supports the following RSS channel tags - use their respective Custom Value to populate the email with the corresponding tag value:</span></p><div class=\"clickup-table-view\" data-identifyelement=\"528\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.4; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; color: rgb(10, 33, 61); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"><table border=\"1\" data-identifyelement=\"529\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; border-collapse: collapse; border-spacing: 0px; max-width: 100%; border: none; empty-cells: show; cursor: default; caption-side: bottom; width: 705.594px;\"><tbody data-identifyelement=\"530\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; border-width: 0px; border-style: solid; border-image: initial; border-color: inherit;\"><tr data-identifyelement=\"531\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; border-width: 0px; border-style: solid; border-image: initial; border-color: inherit;\"><td data-identifyelement=\"532\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 4px; min-width: 5px; cursor: text; font-size: inherit; border: 1px solid rgb(175, 175, 175); width: 352.297px;\"><strong data-identifyelement=\"533\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: bolder;\">RSS Tags</strong></td><td data-identifyelement=\"534\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 4px; min-width: 5px; cursor: text