ate the <strong data-end=\"2369\" data-start=\"2353\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">Text Element</strong> and drag it into your desired position in the layout.</p></li><li data-end=\"2799\" data-start=\"2426\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><p data-end=\"2506\" data-start=\"2429\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\">Click on the <strong data-end=\"2458\" data-start=\"2442\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">Text Element</strong> to open the <strong data-end=\"2479\" data-start=\"2471\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">Edit</strong> tab. From here, you can:</p><ul data-end=\"2799\" data-start=\"2510\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 4px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px 0px 0px 40px; line-height: 17px; list-style: disc;\"><li data-end=\"2569\" data-start=\"2510\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><p data-end=\"2569\" data-start=\"2512\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\">Type or paste your content directly into the text area.</p></li><li data-end=\"2658\" data-start=\"2573\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><p data-end=\"2658\" data-start=\"2575\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\">Use the toolbar to format text (bold, italic, underline, lists, alignment, etc.).</p></li><li data-end=\"2738\